d, so when angle is checked but back isn't, the code still tries to parse from an empty field. I need to replace `isAngnleActivated` with `isBackActivated` on that line and ensure the parsing only happens when the back checkbox is actually selected.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
